  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1ec8f650-f624-43af-819f-bdf109d07396",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Experiment 2 — Balanced 5-Class GRU\n",
    "\n",
    "The initial balanced GRU experiment achieved strong training performance but substantially lower validation performance, indicating overfitting.\n",
    "\n",
    "Training accuracy approached approximately 90%, while validation accuracy remained around the 40–54% range.\n",
    "\n",
    "The confusion matrix showed significant class overlap, particularly among General Medicine, Radiology, and SOAP/Chart/Progress Notes.\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore, this experiment was not selected as the final model."
   ]
  },
