   "source": [
    "## Final Model Evaluation\n",
    "\n",
    "The trained Bidirectional GRU is evaluated on the completely unseen test dataset.\n",
    "\n",
    "The evaluation includes:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Test Accuracy\n",
    "- Precision\n",
    "- Recall\n",
    "- F1-Score\n",
    "- Classification Report\n",
    "- Confusion Matrix"
   ]
  },
